With the Music Cutter: Sound Song Editor, magic feels as if it can occur on your screen while the app processes the waveform. In just seconds, the software makes the clip much lighter for sharing with your friends. All you have to do is tap the start time and let the software do its work. This helps settle those nervous feelings when you are trying to find the perfect beat. Perfect results become possible with the smart mode, activated within the Music Cutter: Sound Song Editor to protect your creative vision.

